WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
In Belgrade there is a building

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:04.620
that looks like a giant Toblerone bar.

3
00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:07.840
This unusual building is in Karaburma.

4
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:10.560
It was built in the early sixties

5
00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:14.320
and is one of the interesting examples of Belgrade modernism.

6
00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:17.180
But the first thing that caught people's eye

7
00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:18.480
was its appearance.

8
00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:20.800
The building has a stepped shape,

9
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.340
with balconies and terraces

10
00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:24.740
that repeat across the whole facade.

11
00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:27.200
Because of this characteristic shape

12
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:30.020
Belgraders eventually nicknamed it "Toblerone."

13
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.940
And it's interesting that this nickname isn't its official name.

14
00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:37.360
It's just one of those Belgrade nicknames

15
00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:38.980
that stuck so well

16
00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:40.960
that today many people immediately understand

17
00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:43.840
which building is meant when you say "Toblerone."